{{also|avulsión}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la|avulsio}} < {{prefix|la|a|vellō}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The [[loss]] or [[separation]] of a [[body]] part, either by [[surgery]] or due to [[trauma]]
# An abrupt change in the [[course]] of a [[river]], typically from one [[channel]] to another
# {{lb|en|hydrology}} Movement of [[soil]] during a flood, or during a change in the [[course]] of a [[river]], especially when a resulting change of [[land]] [[ownership]] is involved

